st will  be available for on-demand viewing  through January 25th 2018 you will  receive an email from lab roots letting  you know when this webcast will be  available for replay please share that  announcement with your colleagues who  may have missed today's live event  that's all for now  thank you for joining us we hope to see  you again soon goodbye
 

